{"kind":"html","caption":"逐个扫描数组，同时维护“以当前位置结尾”的最大乘积和最小乘积，因为负数会让二者交换角色。对示例 [2,3,-2,4]，最大乘积依次为 2、6、-2、4，全局答案在第二步更新为 6。最小乘积虽然不是答案，却能在遇到负数时转化为新的最大乘积。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>乘积最大子数组可视化</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  main{ max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 10px 10px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .intro { margin: 0 0 6px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; }\n  .panel { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; }\n  .panel-title { margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #d4d4d4; }\n  .array { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 6px; }\n  .cell { min-height: 48px; padding: 4px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #2d2d30; text-align: center; transition: background .35s, border-color .35s; }\n  .cell.active { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .mono, .num, .value { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .num { display: block; color: #d4d4d4; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .index { display: block; margin-top: 2px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; }\n  .pointer { display: block; min-height: 12px; font-size:10px; color: #3794ff; }\n  .state-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 6px; }\n  .state-card { min-height: auto; padding: 6px 8px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #2d2d30; }\n  .state-card.emphasis { border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .label { color: #3794ff; font-size: 10px; }\n  .state-card .value { margin-top: 2px; color: #d4d4d4; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .hint { margin-top: 2px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size:10px; }\n  .formula { min-height: auto; padding: 8px 10px; border-left: 3px solid #3794ff; background: #2a2d2e; font-size: 11px; }\n  .formula code { color: #d4d4d4; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .candidates { margin-top: 4px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 11px; }\n  .candidate-value { color: #3794ff; }\n  .timeline { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 4px; }\n  .step { padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #2d2d30; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; }\n  .step.current { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; color: #fff; }\n  .step strong { display: block; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .answer { color: #3794ff; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-weight: 700; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>乘积最大子数组</h1>\n  <p class=\"intro\">示例：<span class=\"mono\">nums = [2, 3, -2, 4]</span>。动画逐步展示最大值与最小值如何共同推进。</p>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">当前扫描位置</div>\n    <div class=\"array\" id=\"array\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">以当前位置结尾的状态</div>\n    <div class=\"state-grid\">\n      <div class=\"state-card emphasis\">\n        <div class=\"label\">最大乘积 maxEnd</div>\n        <div class=\"value\" id=\"maxEnd\">2</div>\n        <div class=\"hint\">必须包含当前元素</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"state-card\">\n        <div class=\"label\">最小乘积 minEnd</div>\n        <div class=\"value\" id=\"minEnd\">2</div>\n        <div class=\"hint\">为后续负数保留机会</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"state-card emphasis\">\n        <div class=\"label\">全局最大值 answer</div>\n        <div class=\"value\" id=\"answer\">2</div>\n        <div class=\"hint\" id=\"answerHint\">当前最佳子数组：[2]</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">本步计算</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">\n      <div id=\"formulaText\"></div>\n      <div class=\"candidates\" id=\"candidates\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">状态轨迹</div>\n    <div class=\"timeline\" id=\"timeline\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">关键结论</div>\n    <div>负数会翻转大小关系，所以不能只保存最大乘积。扫描结束后，全局最大值为 <span class=\"answer\">6</span>，对应连续子数组 <span class=\"answer\">[2, 3]</span>。</div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n  const nums = [2, 3, -2, 4];\n  const states = [\n    { max: 2, min: 2, ans: 2, cand: [2], best: '[2]', note: '首个元素直接初始化两个状态' },\n    { max: 6, min: 3, ans: 6, cand: [3, 6, 6], best: '[2, 3]', note: '继续连接前面的 2，得到更大乘积' },\n    { max: -2, min: -12, ans: 6, cand: [-2, -12, -6], best: '[2, 3]', note: '乘以负数后，原最大值变成最小值' },\n    { max: 4, min: -48, ans: 6, cand: [4, -8, -48], best: '[2, 3]', note: '从 4 重新开始优于接在负乘积之后' }\n  ];\n\n  const arrayEl = document.getElementById('array');\n  const timelineEl = document.getElementById('timeline');\n\n  nums.forEach((n, i) => {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = 'cell';\n    cell.innerHTML = `<span class=\"num\">${n}</span><span class=\"index\">下标 ${i}</span><span class=\"pointer\"></span>`;\n    arrayEl.appendChild(cell);\n\n    const step = document.createElement('div');\n    step.className = 'step';\n    step.innerHTML = `<strong>i = ${i}</strong><span>max=${states[i].max}, min=${states[i].min}</span>`;\n    timelineEl.appendChild(step);\n  });\n\n  function render(i) {\n    const s = states[i];\n    [...arrayEl.children].forEach((cell, index) => {\n      cell.classList.toggle('active', index === i);\n      cell.querySelector('.pointer').textContent = index === i ? '指针 i' : ' ';\n    });\n    [...timelineEl.children].forEach((step, index) => step.classList.toggle('current', index === i));\n\n    document.getElementById('maxEnd').textContent = s.max;\n    document.getElementById('minEnd').textContent = s.min;\n    document.getElementById('answer').textContent = s.ans;\n    document.getElementById('answerHint').textContent = `当前最佳子数组：${s.best}`;\n\n    if (i === 0) {\n      document.getElementById('formulaText').innerHTML = `<code>maxEnd = minEnd = answer = nums[0] = 2</code>`;\n      document.getElementById('candidates').textContent = s.note;\n    } else {\n      const prev = states[i - 1];\n      document.getElementById('formulaText').innerHTML = `<code>从 nums[i]、旧 maxEnd × nums[i]、旧 minEnd × nums[i] 中同时选最大和最小</code>`;\n      document.getElementById('candidates').innerHTML = `候选值：<span class=\"candidate-value\">${s.cand.join('，')}</span>。${s.note}。`;\n    }\n  }\n\n  let index = 0;\n  render(index);\n  setInterval(() => {\n    index = (index + 1) % nums.length;\n    render(index);\n  }, 2300);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
